      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering External Providers**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a concrete external provider for metric retrieval. Prometheus, Datadog, and Google Cloud Monitoring are under consideration. The Python file, `aggregate_metric_stats.py`, will need to be specifically adapted to the chosen provider's API.\n\n\n**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Monitoring. The core Python file, `aggregate_metric_stats.py`, is starting to take shape. I'm focusing on the code outline, including importing the client library, credential setup (placeholder), constructing a `ListTimeSeriesRequest`, and using the `list_time_series` method, taking into account `project_id`, `metric_type`, `end_time`, `start_time`, and `aggregator` as parameters. I will use the `google.cloud.monitoring_v3` client library.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863937320,
